id=flipos
name=flipos (QEMU mobile OS)
version=v0.3.3
versionCode=6
author=legendarymsr
description=Runs the flipos mobile OS in a bundled QEMU directly on Android (KVM, TCG fallback). View it in your browser (noVNC) or any VNC app. Action button starts/stops it. Systemless: no overlay, nothing runs at boot, never writes a partition.
